    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t_m0",
      "x": 70.07515139268241,
      "y": 231.0372572559354,
      "width": 251.953125,
      "height": 184,
      "text": "1. Command ECDH\n   encPubKey + coordPrivKey\n   -> sharedKey for command decrypt\n\n2. Command decrypt\n   encrypted message -> Command\n   stateIndex / voteOption / weight / nonce\n\n3. Signature\n   stateLeaf pubKey signs vote command\n\n4. Step Core\n   check active marker + ActiveStateTree\n   check pollId / nonce / vote option\n   update voteOptionRoot + balance + nonce\n   update StateTree root",
      "originalText": "1. Command ECDH\n   encPubKey + coordPrivKey\n   -> sharedKey for command decrypt\n\n2. Command decrypt\n   encrypted message -> Command\n   stateIndex / voteOption / weight / nonce\n\n3. Signature\n   stateLeaf pubKey signs vote command\n\n4. Step Core\n   check active marker + ActiveStateTree\n   check pollId / nonce / vote option\n   update voteOptionRoot + balance + nonce\n   update StateTree root",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
